a-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1, print pp. 261–275; PDF pp. 283–297; local effective construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; scans 100–101"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}_0\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd76b0e857c90848\" href=\"?note=cd76b0e857c90848\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf\">73-df-epsilon-free-cnf</a>；允许开始符号空词例外的转换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}book\\text{-}cnf\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\land L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}book\\text{-}cnf\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\land L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从带新开始符号的标准 CNF 中删除唯一可能的开始符号空产生式即可；开始符号不出现在右部，所以非空推导不受影响。空语言也可由没有产生式的 CFG 表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-language-class]]，$\\operatorname{CNF}_0$ 见 [[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]；允许开始符号空词例外的转换见 [[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-cfg-language-class]]，$\\operatorname{CNF}_